<title>USA: Datapoint Q1 shr loss $0.15 after gain.</title>
<headline>Datapoint Q1 shr loss $0.15 after gain.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Datapoint Corp</p>
<p>			Oct 26, 1996		 Oct 28, 1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.15     loss	$ 0.13</p>
<p> Net loss		   1,597     loss	 1,204</p>
<p> Revs			32,980		   45,583</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	13,767		   13,214</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except earnings per shr)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company reported an extraordinary gain of $0.06 per share for the first quarter ended Oct 26, 1996 which is included in the information above.</p>
<p>Without the gain, the net loss was $0.21 per share.</p>
</text>
